<p>A block with a language:</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">python</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[def greet(name):
    return f"hello, {name}"]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<p>A block with no language and a tricky comparison:</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[if a > b and b < c {
    return true
}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
